    "text": "<p>Consider two solid spheres of radii <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and masses <math><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math> respectively. The gravitational field due to sphere <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are shown. The value of <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7d4a9bc3-6db6-4301-becd-b6d2a4ee2d68-image.png\" /></p>",
